      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-17T05:50:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After doing a bit of research, I think LibCST codemods (https://libcst.readthedocs.io/en/stable/codemods_tutorial.html) are probably the way to go if we wish to do something like this. There\u0027s an example in Chromite: https://crsrc.org/c/third_party/chromite/contrib/libcst_tool.py",
      "parentUuid": "4cfcc174_4cc611a2",
      "revId": "734f1a6355f92238fcd5626238da6073a5da63da",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
